{"t":"BG","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"Bunge Global SA","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","employees":34000,"hq":"Chesterfield, MO, United States","website":"https://www.bunge.com","summary_en":"Bunge Global SA operates as an agribusiness and food company worldwide. It operates through four segments: Soybean Processing and Refining, Softseed Processing and Refining, Other Oilseeds Processing and Refining, and Grain Merchandising and Milling. The Soybean Processing and Refining segment is involved in the purchase, storage, transportation, processing, distribution, refining, marketing, and sale of soybeans and soybean related products, as well as biodiesel and fertilizer production and distribution for the food, animal feed and biofuel industries. The Softseed Processing and Refining segment is involved in the purchase, storage, transportation, processing, distribution, refining, marketing, and sale of softseeds and softseed related products, as well as biodiesel production and distribution. The Other Oilseeds Processing and Refining Segment is involved in products of a specialty nature, including the purchase, storage, transportation, processing, distribution, refining, marketing, and sale of these related products. The Grain Merchandising and Milling segment is involved in the purchase, storage, transportation, distribution, and marketing of commodities primarily consisting of corn, wheat, barley, cotton, pulses, and sugar; milling of wheat and sugar; and related services including ocean freight and financial services. Bunge Global SA was founded in 1818 and is headquartered in Chesterfield, Missouri.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Bunge Global SA는 전 세계적으로 농업 및 식품 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 대두 가공 및 정제, 연질 종자 가공 및 정제, 기타 유지종자 가공 및 정제, 곡물 판매 및 제분 등 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 대두 가공 및 정제 부문은 대두 및 대두 관련 제품의 구매, 저장, 운송, 가공, 유통, 정제, 마케팅 및 판매뿐만 아니라 식품, 동물 사료 및 바이오 연료 산업을 위한 바이오디젤 및 비료 생산 및 유통에도 관여합니다. Softseed 가공 및 정제 부문은 Softseed 및 Softseed 관련 제품의 구매, 저장, 운송, 가공, 유통, 정제, 마케팅 및 판매뿐만 아니라 바이오디젤 생산 및 유통에도 관여합니다. 기타 유지종자 가공 및 정제 부문은 관련 제품의 구매, 보관, 운송, 가공, 유통, 정제, 마케팅 및 판매를 포함한 특수 제품과 관련됩니다. 곡물 상품화 및 제분 부문은 주로 옥수수, 밀, 보리, 면화, 콩류 및 설탕으로 구성된 상품의 구매, 저장, 운송, 유통 및 마케팅에 관여합니다. 밀과 설탕의 제분; 해상 화물 및 금융 서비스를 포함한 관련 서비스. Bunge Global SA는 1818년에 설립되었으며 미주리주 체스터필드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":99.1,"mcap":19041447936.0,"pe":17.02749,"fpe":8.990138,"peg":null,"ps":0.20372157,"pb":1.1684668,"ev_ebitda":11.081,"div":2.92,"beta":0.678,"hi52":134.87,"lo52":88.24},"fin":{"rev":93468000256.0,"rev_g":0.074,"eps_g":0.947,"gross":0.052059997,"op":0.03462,"net":0.0124,"roe":0.0692,"fcf":-3016875008.0,"cash":890000000.0,"debt":18727000064.0,"de":104.737,"eps":5.82,"feps":11.02319},"own":{"short":0.0589,"inst":0.80420995,"insider":0.18367},"analyst":{"n":9,"mean":139.22221,"median":140.0,"high":155.0,"low":116.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.55556,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":139.0,"priorPriceTarget":140.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-10","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":155.0,"priorPriceTarget":145.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-04-30","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":150.0,"priorPriceTarget":145.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-04-01","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":145.0,"priorPriceTarget":135.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-03-24","Firm"